# Web App Package UX

- Keep the web app centered on: Upload -> Package Recipe -> Produce -> Download/Review.
- Do not promote screen capture or recorder setup in the web app primary navigation. The desktop recorder is separate, later work.
- Use action-oriented CTAs: `Create New Package With Current Recipe`, `Download Previous Package`, `Open Project`.
- Duplicate flows must separate old output from new output: reuse/download the previous ZIP, or create a new package using current settings.
- Audio setup must be explicit: default to original video audio; show separate audio upload only when the user chooses to replace audio.
- Package copy must describe the actual deliverables: one 16:9 highlights edit, one 9:16 goal reel, optional merged master, caption assets, and embedded event text when enabled.
- Status cards should show current state, next action, and recovery path before internal implementation details.
